WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.240
<b>Chio in the Middle of the Night</b>

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.980
Go, go, go!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.530
Hurry! Hurry!

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:40.740
There it is! The safe!

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.390
Alpha! Charlie! Make it rain bullets!

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:44.290
Got it.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.640
We'll advance toward the wall from the side.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.880
Delta, ready the RPG.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:49.710
Roger.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.130
Now! Run!

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:00.980
All right, clear!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.930
The next wave is coming. Stand by!

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.560
It's here!

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:06.710
RPG!

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.270
A clean hit! Just a little more, boys!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.560
Take this!

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:22.620
<b>Congratulations.
Now the safe's right in front of you.</b>

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.320
Woohoo! We did it!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.120
It's all thanks to you, Bloody Butterfly!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.050
No problem!

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.020
We're finally at the safe!

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.130
Get the equipment out!

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.800
And now... to finish this.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.300
Hey, a stun grenade.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.100
A stun grenade?!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:54.400
The six million dollars 
in the safe... is all mine!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.900
You bastard! You betrayed us!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.050
I'll kill you!

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.780
Say what you want!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.790
Chio! Have you been up 
playing all night again?!

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:30.830
Huh?

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.360
What the heck, Mom?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.360
You left the light on again!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.940
You can't get good sleep with lights on.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.250
I won't come wake you up if you oversleep!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.750
You're the one who's keeping me up.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.290
Honestly... I don't know how 
to turn off your computer,

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.210
so you need to turn it off 
before going to bed!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:05.060
<i>Now she's just being a sore loser, 
still trying to lecture me...</i>

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:06.270
You always tell me not to touch your 
things, but you never do it yourself.

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.180
<i>I win.</i>

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:09.370
I told you, we're trying to 
cut our electricity bill.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.390
You'd better get up yourself tomorrow!

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.180
I'm not waking you up!

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.390
<i>Shit! Shit! I'm pretty sure 
I blasted them all away,</i>

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.050
<i>but if any of them survived,</i>

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:32.450
<i>they've probably beaten the crap out of me!</i>

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.960
<b>"Your comrades are dead. 
The money's all yours."</b>

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.840
<b>Base points
Bonus points
Kill points</b>

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.970
<i>I got six million dollars!</i>

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.120
That was probably the most epic game

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:59.110
I've ever played in my 
whole online gaming career!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.070
<b>Base points
Bonus points
Kill points</b>

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:02.320
<i>I'm just gonna take the money and run.</i>

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.740
There we go...

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.240
Ready, and...

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.370
Goodnight!

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.600
<i>Shit... I can't sleep.</i>

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.140
<i>I never thought it'd go that perfectly.</i>

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.030
<i>Just thinking about those 
dumb bastards I betrayed</i>

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:39.060
<i>shaking in anger under 
the same night sky as me...</i>

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.660
<i>Sh-Shit... I can't stop laughing.</i>

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.040
dollars

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.040
716,580,000 yen

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:56.040
<i>710,000,000 yen.</i>

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.420
<i>I'm pretty rich now.</i>

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.290
<i>I'm not entirely sure, but... 
as rich as this manga artist, maybe?</i>

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.460
<i>Wait a sec.</i>

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.030
<i>If I really do have what 
it takes to be a gangster</i>

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.890
<i>and could actually obtain 
this much money in reality...</i>

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.020
<i>All my worries about my commute 
would be gone in an instant.</i>

