<i>Idiot... Idiot... Idiot...</i>

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.000
<b>Idiot corrupted by movies or video games</b>

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:45.800
<i>I see... So it's possible to do things in games 
that are impossible IRL, not vice versa...</i>

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.130
<i>But then...</i>

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:55.810
<i>Why are there still wars when 
we have war video games?</i>

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.820
<i>I just don't get it...</i>

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.060
I fell asleep...

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:07.310
What time is it?

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:12.030
<i>Uh... I'm looking at it upside-down...</i>

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.830
<i>If I flip that around...</i>

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.580
8 AM?!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.710
Shit! Shit! Shit! Oh, shit!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.340
But I'm still okay, as long as I don't 
run into trouble on my way to school!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.930
I'll get there in plenty of time...

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.220
It's 4 AM, damn it!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.490
Chio! What on Earth are you doing?!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.430
Huh?!

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:40.140
W-Well... There was a cockroach...

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.880
Then why are you changing?

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.190
Ah...

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.560
I'm psyching myself up by 
transforming... or something?

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.480
Chio...

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.150
Are you honestly okay?

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.910
<i>Crap, she's serious.</i>

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.330
Why don't you stay home today 
so I can take you to the hospital?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.660
I'm totally fine, okay?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.990
Are you sure you don't need 
to go to the hospital?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:03.080
I'm fine! I'm totally fine!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.420
<i>Now I've done it!</i>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.720
<i>Shit... I can't believe I misread the clock!</i>

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.690
<i>But now I've got a huge problem on my hands.</i>

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.830
<i>And that's... to sleep or not to sleep?</i>

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.200
<b>To sleep or not to sleep?</b>

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:28.320
<b>Depth of sleep</b>

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:28.320
<b>Length of sleep</b>

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.400
<i>I'm completely awake now 
after freaking out like that,</i>

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:28.320
<i>so if I try to sleep now, I'll have to wake up 
right when I get to my deep sleep stage.</i>

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:31.700
<i>I have a really hard time waking 
up to the sound of alarms.</i>

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:32.580
<i>This is Bravo 1! Someone come in! Someone!</i>

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:36.160
<i>There are times when I fall asleep during 
shootouts in a game and don't wake up.</i>

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.240
Nag, nag, nag, nag, nag, nag...

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.240
<i>The way she was going on,
Mom probably really won't wake me up...</i>

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.240
Yeah,
yeah...

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.910
<i>I need to consider the worst case 
scenario in this situation...</i>

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:44.790
<b>If I sleep</b>

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.020
Crap! I totally overslept!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.520
Oh, hey. What's up?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.720
Oh, so you didn't take the 
day off from school today.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.720
Do you think it could be...

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.870
<i>The suspicion that something's 
up with the kid who comes</i>

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.020
Nah, maybe she's sick?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.660
<i>to school in the afternoon really sucks.</i>

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.220
<b>If I don't sleep</b>

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.500
Yeah, I didn't get any sleep at all.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.230
Really? Don't you feel exhausted, then?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.800
No, actually, my body... feels really light!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.240
Just kidding...

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.970
<i>Either way, I'd rather 
not stand out in class.</i>

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:23.300
<i>My peaceful school life could be 
ruined by these little occurrences.</i>

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.920
What should I do?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:49.020
Chio-chan AM 4:22
Subject: Tomorrow
Let's meet up at the shrine tomorrow.
The same time as usual.
Make sure you're not late.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:46.410
<i>Let's meet up at the shrine tomorrow.</i>

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.020
<i>The same time as usual. 
Make sure you're not late.</i>

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:53.940
<i>She didn't have to add that at 
the end. I've never been late.</i>

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.490
<b>Chio-chan</b>

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.490
Subject: Tomorrow

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:56.490
<i>Whoa, she sent this at 4:30 AM...</i>

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.430
<i>Why the hell would she send it at that hour?</i>

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.450
<i>She must've been playing games again.</i>

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:04.540
<i>Did she even sleep?</i>

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.000
<i>It's rare for Chio-chan 
to show up before me...</i>

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:19.800
<i>Please, by some miracle...</i>

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.090
<i>Don't let this weirdo be my best friend...</i>

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.950
You finally woke up!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.110
Morning, Chio-chan.

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:45.010
Man, I slept so well.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.620
My plan to have you wake me up was a success.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.160
Were you really sleeping this 
whole time under that thing?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:52.960
You stood out like a sore thumb.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.010
The game I was playing gave me the idea.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.800
It doesn't matter in the end, as long 
as people don't find out who I am.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:01.910
Huh?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.000
What's wrong?

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.560
My head's starting to throb...

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:09.540
Ow! What the hell?! 
Ow, ow! It hurts so much!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.940
It's probably from lack of sleep.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:15.160
Seriously? Man, staying up all night sucks.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.320
Ow...

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.280
Right?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.460
Ow, ow, ow...

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.240
<i>Right. It doesn't matter in the end, 
as long as people don't find out...</i>

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.240
What is this?

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.560
<i>As long as they don't find out...</i>

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.530
Wake up. Chio-chan. It's morning.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.390
<i>As long as they don't find out.</i>

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.610
Wake up, you bastard.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:36.090
<b>Chio's</b>

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:36.090
School Road

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.120
<i>Chio's School Road</i>!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.090
Okay, fine.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.800
What would you do if you had 700 million yen?

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.030
What? 700 million yen?

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.690
Yeah, I made that much yesterday.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.010
Shinozuka.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:43.700
What're you talking about?

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.250
Yes, sir?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.680
I got it in my game.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.340
What would you do if you 
received 700 million yen?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.770
Of course...

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.470
Huh? W-Well, um, I...

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:54.690
<i>To say I'd put it in savings would be cliché. 
I don't want him to think I'm dull...</i>

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.750
<i>I-I need to come up with something funny...</i>

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.320
U-Um...

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.280
I-I'd pay my taxes.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.860
<i>God, I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.130
If the local government's budget increased,

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.050
I think everyone would be better off.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.330
Just the answer I'd expect from you.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.220
Right!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:17.210
<b>Apocri!</b>

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:19.460
<b>We want to know more!!    Before summer arrives</b>

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:19.460
<b>A special on summer smells</b>

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.160
<i>Now, for our special this week,</i>

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.460
<i>we'll be covering the troubling 
issue of body odor!</i>

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.130
Odor, huh? Has nothing to do with m—

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.640
<i>Did you know?</i>

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.940
<i>There are many times</i>

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.390
<b>You might have BO, too</b>

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.390
<b>Haven't noticed personally</b>

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.390
<b>Have noticed personally</b>

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.390
<b>Other</b>

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.920
<i>when you don't even notice your own BO.</i>

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.140
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:35.400
<i>Many think that BO only affects men,</i>

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.860
<i>but actually, more and more 
women are being affected by it.</i>

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.640
<i>I'm sure many of us plan to wear 
lighter clothing this season.</i>

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.500
<i>There are some pitfalls 
that women might fall into,</i>

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.360
<i>despite how hard they 
work to avoid UV rays...</i>

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.180
Say, Chio-chan...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:00.550
Do I... ever smell bad?

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:03.610
Huh? Well, if I had to choose, 
I'd say you are pretty fishy...

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.130
That's not what I meant!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.710
They were talking about 
BO on TV yesterday...

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.180
And you can't really tell yourself.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:15.230
So could you... check for me?

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.270
Huh?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.530
No, no. You're fine. Really.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.500
Come on!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.570
Please!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.800
What?

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.070
Fine, then...

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:27.910
W-Well?

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.370
Yeah, you don't smell.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:36.000
Thank goodness! I was so 
worried, I couldn't sleep!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:38.830
Well, I mean, humans are animals, too.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.460
I think you're just worrying too much.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.550
I see.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.070
By the way—

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.760
Okay, let me smell you now.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.180
No way! Somehow I knew that was coming!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.220
You know... For science.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.840
No! No way! It's embarrassing!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.520
Well, I was embarrassed, too!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.560
But you asked me to do it!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.650
Don't worry...

00:13:57.990 --> 00:13:59.310
I'm just checking.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:02.160
No way! Now I'm getting really nervous!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.610
Hey! What the hell was that technique?!

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.370
Now you can't move.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.950
Stop it!

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:23.360
<i>What... was that overpowering beastly odor?</i>

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.460
<i>My nose is still on my face... right?</i>

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.790
So... How was it?

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.040
Huh?!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:35.460
Um... It was completely... normal.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.610
Oh, thank goodness!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:41.730
<i>I-I can't tell her it was a smell that 
nearly ripped my nose off my face...</i>

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:45.250
<i>To think that Chio-chan 
had such an ability...</i>

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.940
<i>I had no idea.</i>

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:50.030
<i>Why hadn't I realized it until now?</i>

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.700
<i>I get it!</i>

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.580
<i>We've always been together 
ever since we were little,</i>

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.910
<i>so my nose must've eventually 
gotten used to it...</i>

00:14:58.640 --> 00:14:59.710
Manana?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.890
<i>I finally understand everything...</i>

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:06.380
<i>including the reason Chio-chan became so 
obsessed with being less than average.</i>

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:10.530
<i>The reason that Chio-chan became so 
withdrawn without even realizing it...</i>

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.460
Hey, let's have a party!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.050
I want to go, too.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.180
Yeah, so we'll be canceling that...

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>...must be because she was hurt over 
and over because of her condition.</i>

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:14.990
Huh?!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.270
But why?!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:23.620
<i>Chio-chan, I'm so sorry... 
that I hadn't noticed until now...</i>

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.530
Manana?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.320
<i>This whole time...</i>

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.560
<i>This whole time...</i>

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.960
<i>I've been with you this whole time...</i>

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:36.160
Chio-chan, this is for you.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.820
Huh? What, why? I can really have it?

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.790
I was just getting thirsty!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.040
<i>Hang on a second.</i>

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.710
<i>The fact that we've been together 
this whole time would mean..</i>

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.300
<i>that it affects me, too, right?</i>

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:52.890
<i>Come to think of it, there was...</i>

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.130
Oh, cut it out, Makiyama-kun!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:57.340
<i>Makiyama-kun, the boy in our
class that I got close to...</i>

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.640
Well, it's true.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.230
<i>I was positive that he had feelings for me...</i>

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:05.150
<i>But next thing I knew, he was going 
out with some plain-as-hell girl.</i>

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.780
Oh, cut it out, Makiyama-kun!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.150
Okay, maybe next time.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:08.910
<i>I knew that I was his first choice...</i>

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.820
Sorry... I have someone else that I like.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.820
Nonomura-san from our class?

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:18.950
I-I see...

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.770
I guess you don't know, Makiyama-kun...

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:22.590
Huh?

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:23.830
Well, you see...

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.590
She's best friends with Wild Game.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.960
W-Wild Game? You mean that girl with 
the glasses and the wild animal BO?

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:35.760
Yup. They're BFFs. All the girls know...

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.310
that if you hang out with Nonomura,

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.530
you might get it, too.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.480
That wild game stench...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.150
Man, that was close!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.230
I totally almost fell for her! Thanks, man!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:55.740
Oh, it was nothing! I was just 
worried about you, Makiyama-kun!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.420
Chi...o...cha...n...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:03.410
Manana?! What the hell is 
going on with your emotions?!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.880
Hey, Manana!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:06.870
<i>Because of Chio—I mean, Wild Game...</i>

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.880
What's wrong? Have you gone crazy?

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:11.000
<i>My normie life was... But... But...</i>

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:11.000
Don't do it! Don't go crazy!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.130
<i>But!</i>

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.220
What the hell's wrong with you?

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.380
You're fine, Manana! You don't smell!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:19.300
That's not it!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.690
It's you, Wild Game.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.520
<i>Thinking about what you've been through...</i>

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.960
<i>and what you're going to go through...</i>

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.820
<i>Ah... You reek.</i>

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:39.230
<i>But still, I... I...</i>

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.370
I love you, Wild Game!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:52.520
<i>Uh... Wild game is like... 
meat from wild animals, right?</i>

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:54.240
<i>The hell?</i>

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.220
<i>Does she think eating smelly 
meat will make her stink, too?</i>

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.350
<i>Is she dumb?</i>

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.640
I've made up my mind.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.510
I'll stick with you for life, Wild Game.

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:08.230
<i>Huh? Is she going to become 
a hunter or something?</i>

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.190
I'll always...

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.110
be by your side!

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:13.650
Let's continue being a burden

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.000
to society together!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.300
Hello? Yuki-chan?

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:23.120
Sorry to call you out of the blue. 
Yeah, Manana's acting weird.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.270
Could you come by?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.870
<i>You called Yuki-san?</i>

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.120
Yeah...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.960
<i>That's perfect, actually. 
For a brutal truth like this...</i>

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:30.400
I mean, I know she's always weird, 
but this is beyond explanation.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:35.090
Like, something's really wrong with her.
I seriously can't even explain it!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:34.740
<i>It's best to have someone 
sincere and honest tell you.</i>

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.880
Yeah...

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.480
The day of reckoning is nigh!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:41.220
Uh... Yeah. Please hurry.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.750
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.600
You're so fast, Yuki-chan!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:47.730
<i>So you've come!</i>

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:53.040
<i>But that girl... is just a smiling reaper.</i>

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:50.150
Not at all!

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:58.360
I'm glad you could make it, 
Death Scythe Hosokawa.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.050
See?

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.240
You're right...

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.830
Yuki-san, there's something 
that I need you to confirm.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.930
And I need you to be completely honest.

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.670
Yeah! You don't smell at all!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:12.960
Huh?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.810
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.660
Huh?! You don't have to be 
nice, Yuki-san! Be honest!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:22.930
I am, though! I can't lie!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.080
Then let me smell!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.680
What?!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.490
She's right! You don't stink!

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:34.730
No, I don't!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:39.070
But I could've sworn I smelled some 
tremendous beastly smell earlier...

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.880
Actually, now that you mention it...

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.280
It reeks! What the hell?!

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:51.120
My nose is still on my face, right?

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.560
Why is it just here?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.460
Come to think of it, 
when I left the house today...

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:01.630
There, there, good boy. 
You're so full of energy again.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:06.490
Hey, stop it. I'm ticklish there.

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.390
It must be Chop's saliva.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.450
Do doggies' mouths smell that bad?

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.180
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:16.150
<i>It's all because of her dog. 
Chio-chan doesn't actually smell.</i>

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.150
Well, my dog's teeth are really bad.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:21.200
<i>Thank goodness. Wild Game didn't 
actually exist in this world.</i>

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.190
<i>Then why...</i>

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.120
<i>didn't Makiyama-kun choose me?!</i>

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:30.960
I'm gonna go to the bathroom in 
the convenience store to wipe it off.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.100
Okay!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:37.250
S-Say... Do you know 
Makiyama-kun from our class?

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:39.550
Oh, you mean Kensuke-kun.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.660
<i>Oh, you're on a first-name basis...</i>

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:45.890
I-It seems like he got 
a girlfriend recently...

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:51.060
I was... sort of going for him.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.450
Really?

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.190
Oh, but you haven't actually 
asked him out, right?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.300
Huh? Right...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.360
Thank goodness!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:04.030
You see, Kensuke-kun only likes pretty girls.

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.300
You don't say...

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:06.870
<i>Ah...</i>

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.240
<i>Death Scythe Hosokawa...</i>

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:13.660
<i>You truly are a cruel angel...</i>

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:13.130
I'm back!

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.520
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:20.710
<i>Since Makiyama-kun only likes pretty 
girls, I didn't stand a chance!</i>

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.900
<i>Thank goodness I didn't get hurt!</i>

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.730
Sniff, sniff, sniff, whiff, whiff, whiff.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.770
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.770
School Road

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:32.470
Ah, what a lovely scent.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:36.690
What do you smell like, Momo-senpai?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:37.720
Yeah!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.240
Yeah!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.570
Where did that come from?

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:43.570
Sensei, you always have a 
girl standing next to you.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.280
I hope you're mindful of how you smell.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.390
Oh, but...

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:52.790
I don't mind the smell of 
a hard-working older man...

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.070
<i>Older man?</i>

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.030
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>...

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:30.550
Really?!

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:31.950
"Just One Masterful Method"...

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:32.690
What?

00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:35.450
...and "Yuki-chan Bares It All."

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:36.350
Look forward to it!

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.980
La, la, la, the last episode!
